// [BUILTIN-LIST-SORT] listSort is constrained to List<int> and List<string>.
// A float list would compare IEEE-754 bit patterns, a bool list its storage
// words and a record list its heap addresses, so every other element type is
// rejected before codegen instead of sorted in a meaningless order.
fn main() = print(listLength(listSort([1.5, 2.5])))
